The expectOwnershipClause helper (introduced Sprint 1.5 BATCH 4 in
biometrics.test.ts, reused Sprint 2 BATCH 7 in notifications.test.ts) is
now the third verification site of the same mutation-test pattern —
removing an IDOR ownership clause from a load-bearing WHERE causes the
matching test to fail with a column-aware diagnostic.
